stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Not recorded" as NR
  [*] --> Decide: lesson starts
  state Decide <<choice>>
  Decide --> NR: account has Record lessons off
  Decide --> NR: a student has not given consent
  Decide --> Pending: recording on and all consented
  Pending --> Uploaded: room ends, file arrives
  Uploaded --> Ready: processed, usually within 30 min
  Pending --> Failed: audio lost
  Uploaded --> Failed: processing fails
  Ready --> Deleted: retention reached 30, 90 or 365 days
  Ready --> Deleted: tutor deletes, no undo
  Ready --> Deleted: student data deletion, one-to-one only
  Failed --> [*]
  NR --> [*]
  Deleted --> [*]
